# Web Performance

## Defaults

Lazy loading, code splitting, image optimization, responsive images, caching, minimal JavaScript, font optimization, compression.

## Measure before optimizing

Track LCP, CLS, INP, TTFB, bundle size, image weight, request count.

## Critical content

Do not lazy-load above-the-fold content that harms comprehension or accessibility.

## Migration performance baseline

Record current site performance metrics during audit in `docs/seo/TECHNICAL-SEO-AUDIT.md`.
New site must meet or exceed baseline scores.

## Images

Use modern formats (WebP, AVIF where supported). Provide width and height attributes. Use srcset for responsive images.
